{"suttaId":"thag3.4","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[1174,1183],"vripara":"228"},"segments":{"thag3.4:0.4":"Dhaniyattheragāthā","thag3.4:1.1":"“Sukhaṃ ce jīvituṃ icche, sāmaññasmiṃ apekkhavā;","thag3.4:1.3":"Saṅghikaṃ nātimaññeyya, cīvaraṃ pānabhojanaṃ.","thag3.4:2.1":"“Sukhaṃ ce jīvituṃ icche, sāmaññasmiṃ apekkhavā;","thag3.4:2.3":"Ahi mūsikasobbhaṃva, sevetha sayanāsanaṃ.","thag3.4:3.1":"“Sukhaṃ ce jīvituṃ icche, sāmaññasmiṃ apekkhavā;","thag3.4:3.3":"Itarītarena tusseyya, ekadhammañca bhāvaye”ti.","thag3.4:3.5":"… Dhaniyo thero …."},"attha":{"book":"Th-a-i","bookName":"Theragāthā-1-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0508a1.att","from":4788,"to":4788,"paras":[{"para":4788,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag3.4:3"],"lines":["Idāni vutte avutte ca paccaye yathālābhasantoseneva sāmaññasukhaṃ hoti, na aññathāti dassento āha <b>“itarītarena tusseyyā”</b>ti, yena kenaci hīnena vā paṇītena vā yathāladdhena paccayena santosaṃ āpajjeyyāti attho.","<b>Ekadhamman</b>ti appamādabhāvaṃ, tañhi anuyuñjantassa anavajjaṃ sabbaṃ lokiyasukhaṃ lokuttarasukhañca hatthagatameva hoti.","Tenāha bhagavā –","“appamatto hi jhāyanto, pappoti vipulaṃ sukhan”ti (ma. ni.2.352; dha. pa.27)."],"lineRefs":[["thag3.4:3"],["thag3.4:3"],["thag3.4:3"],["thag3.4:3"]]}],"wordLinks":[["thag3.4:3.3","itarītarena tusseyyā",0,0],["thag3.4:3.3","ekadhammaṃ",0,1]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
